                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game has great goal to show difference between well-situated and poor people. That is awesome. But the game is nearly unplayable for longer than 5mins.\nThe controls are awful, there is no feedback that we are running out of time and we have to hurry up. I didnt even get what is this \"Turns left\" about. Great, I have more turns, but after 2nd one I was bored. The panel with ladders has so slow animation that it takes great percent of time to expand it. Same with zooming out to see area near my character.\nAnd really, there is nothing happening. Just build up, avoid cloud and realise, that when you are poor you get more things that block you. Isn't that obvious for everyone?",
